{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become a Combat Helicopter Pilot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gunship: Origins is a modern combat helicopter game inspired by the golden age of military simulators. Fly iconic helicopters including the <strong>AH-64 Apache, OH-58 Kiowa Warrior, and UH-60 Blackhawk</strong> in dynamic missions across contested battlefields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your routes, coordinate with wingmen, and strike enemy forces ranging from armored columns and convoys to missile batteries and fortified bases. The battlefield is dangerous - survival depends on flying low, using terrain to your advantage, and striking fast before the enemy can react.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055780/extras/2c2736d9d7cf23606cbd9a0e7792c6b7.poster.avif?t=1774008322\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055780/extras/2c2736d9d7cf23606cbd9a0e7792c6b7.webm?t=1774008322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055780/extras/2c2736d9d7cf23606cbd9a0e7792c6b7.mp4?t=1774008322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Missions and Campaigns</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two missions are the same. Missions are dynamically generated and place you in a wide variety of combat situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may be tasked with destroying armored columns, escorting transport helicopters into hostile landing zones, intercepting enemy convoys, or striking high-value targets deep behind enemy lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission demands careful planning and quick decision-making once you reach the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055780/extras/f5426a6d038c941efdafc87b4cfd201e.poster.avif?t=1774008322\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055780/extras/f5426a6d038c941efdafc87b4cfd201e.webm?t=1774008322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055780/extras/f5426a6d038c941efdafc87b4cfd201e.mp4?t=1774008322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fly Solo or With Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the cockpit alone or fly together in <strong>co-operative multiplayer with up to 8 players</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the pilot seat while a friend operates the weapons as copilot/gunner, or lead a coordinated flight of helicopters with human and AI wingmen working together to accomplish mission objectives.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rise Through the Ranks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your career as a <strong>Warrant Officer Candidate</strong> and prove yourself through training and combat missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn promotions through the US Army officer ranks, unlock new responsibilities, and collect authentic military medals and awards as your career progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your hard-earned rank and medals into multiplayer and show your friends what you\u2019ve accomplished.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Accessible Yet Deep</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gunship: Origins is designed to be easy to learn but rewarding to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The helicopters can be flown with <strong>keyboard and mouse</strong>, making the game accessible even on a laptop. For players seeking deeper immersion, joysticks, gamepads, <strong>HOTAS and other advanced control setups</strong> are fully supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive optimization ensures smooth performance across a wide range of systems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly <strong>AH-64 Apache, OH-58 Kiowa Warrior, UH-60 Blackhawk</strong>, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic mission generation</strong> with varied objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer and 8-player co-op multiplayer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot career progression with <strong>ranks, medals, and awards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command AI wingmen and coordinate flight operations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrain-based combat using <strong>real-world terrain data</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible controls with support for <strong>keyboard/mouse and HOTAS</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross-platform support for <strong>Windows, macOS, Linux, and Steam Deck</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055780/extras/e8ed4f8405968acc00ddc31649f94c47.poster.avif?t=1774008322\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055780/extras/e8ed4f8405968acc00ddc31649f94c47.webm?t=1774008322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055780/extras/e8ed4f8405968acc00ddc31649f94c47.mp4?t=1774008322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4055780?t=1774008322","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055780/bc8ff924cfd4532ac2aae88dce66f7cea803e63d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774008322","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055780/af70d54710ee354536b9e6b88845f1ce4fa54f1a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774008322","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055780/af70d54710ee354536b9e6b88845f1ce4fa54f1a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774008322","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become a Combat Helicopter Pilot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gunship: Origins is a modern combat helicopter game inspired by the golden age of military simulators. Fly iconic helicopters including the <strong>AH-64 Apache, OH-58 Kiowa Warrior, and UH-60 Blackhawk</strong> in dynamic missions across contested battlefields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your routes, coordinate with wingmen, and strike enemy forces ranging from armored columns and convoys to missile batteries and fortified bases. The battlefield is dangerous - survival depends on flying low, using terrain to your advantage, and striking fast before the enemy can react.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055780/extras/2c2736d9d7cf23606cbd9a0e7792c6b7.poster.avif?t=1774008322\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055780/extras/2c2736d9d7cf23606cbd9a0e7792c6b7.webm?t=1774008322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055780/extras/2c2736d9d7cf23606cbd9a0e7792c6b7.mp4?t=1774008322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Missions and Campaigns</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two missions are the same. Missions are dynamically generated and place you in a wide variety of combat situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may be tasked with destroying armored columns, escorting transport helicopters into hostile landing zones, intercepting enemy convoys, or striking high-value targets deep behind enemy lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission demands careful planning and quick decision-making once you reach the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055780/extras/f5426a6d038c941efdafc87b4cfd201e.poster.avif?t=1774008322\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055780/extras/f5426a6d038c941efdafc87b4cfd201e.webm?t=1774008322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055780/extras/f5426a6d038c941efdafc87b4cfd201e.mp4?t=1774008322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fly Solo or With Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the cockpit alone or fly together in <strong>co-operative multiplayer with up to 8 players</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the pilot seat while a friend operates the weapons as copilot/gunner, or lead a coordinated flight of helicopters with human and AI wingmen working together to accomplish mission objectives.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rise Through the Ranks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your career as a <strong>Warrant Officer Candidate</strong> and prove yourself through training and combat missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn promotions through the US Army officer ranks, unlock new responsibilities, and collect authentic military medals and awards as your career progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your hard-earned rank and medals into multiplayer and show your friends what you\u2019ve accomplished.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Accessible Yet Deep</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gunship: Origins is designed to be easy to learn but rewarding to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The helicopters can be flown with <strong>keyboard and mouse</strong>, making the game accessible even on a laptop. For players seeking deeper immersion, joysticks, gamepads, <strong>HOTAS and other advanced control setups</strong> are fully supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive optimization ensures smooth performance across a wide range of systems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly <strong>AH-64 Apache, OH-58 Kiowa Warrior, UH-60 Blackhawk</strong>, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic mission generation</strong> with varied objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer and 8-player co-op multiplayer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot career progression with <strong>ranks, medals, and awards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command AI wingmen and coordinate flight operations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrain-based combat using <strong>real-world terrain data</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible controls with support for <strong>keyboard/mouse and HOTAS</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross-platform support for <strong>Windows, macOS, Linux, and Steam Deck</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055780/extras/e8ed4f8405968acc00ddc31649f94c47.poster.avif?t=1774008322\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055780/extras/e8ed4f8405968acc00ddc31649f94c47.webm?t=1774008322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055780/extras/e8ed4f8405968acc00ddc31649f94c47.mp4?t=1774008322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Jammin Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055780/2b163431440054e371765fb8bc4c880e101edff6/header.jpg?t=1774008322","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2025-present Jamon Holmgren DBA Jammin Games","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any distribution<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.12<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</s